{"id":"4ece23a62bf5b687","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-modal-root-duplication.md","title":"复制根保持有限受检公式的真值","display":"lem-modal-root-duplication — 复制根保持有限受检公式的真值","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-modal-root-duplication","aliases":["72-lem-modal-root-duplication"],"display":"lem-modal-root-duplication — 复制根保持有限受检公式的真值","depends_on":["[[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Lemma2.6, print480/PDF492; explicit tagged construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"将新增世界集构造移入 Assertion，保留结构参数声明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-modal-root-duplication"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-modal-root-duplication</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-modal-root-duplication — 复制根保持有限受检公式的真值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"856b3762c593e8c1\" href=\"?note=856b3762c593e8c1\" title=\"72-df-root-sound-modal-model\">72-df-root-sound-modal-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Lemma2.6, print480/PDF492; explicit tagged construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"将新增世界集构造移入 Assertion，保留结构参数声明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\)</span> 是传递非自反框架上的模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 是根；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 对子公式封闭，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi}(\\mathcal M,w)\">\\(\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi}(\\mathcal M,w)\\)</span>。语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"856b3762c593e8c1\" href=\"?note=856b3762c593e8c1\" title=\"72-df-root-sound-modal-model\">72-df-root-sound-modal-model</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W&#39;,w&#39;\">\\(W&#39;,w&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;,V&#39;,\\mathcal M&#39;\">\\(R&#39;,V&#39;,\\mathcal M&#39;\\)</span> 由下式给出，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Phi\">\\(A\\in\\Phi\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W&#39;:=\\{0\\}\\times W\\ \\cup\\ \\{\\langle1,w\\rangle\\},\\qquad w&#39;:=\\langle1,w\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W&#39;:=\\{0\\}\\times W\\ \\cup\\ \\{\\langle1,w\\rangle\\},\\qquad w&#39;:=\\langle1,w\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR&#39;&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle0,u\\rangle,\\langle0,v\\rangle\\rangle:R(u,v)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle w&#39;,\\langle0,v\\rangle\\rangle:v\\in W\\},\\\\\nV&#39;(i)&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,v\\rangle:v\\in V(i)\\}\\cup\\{w&#39;:w\\in V(i)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M&#39;&amp;:=\\langle W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal M&#39;,w&#39;\\Vdash_m A&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR&#39;&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle0,u\\rangle,\\langle0,v\\rangle\\rangle:R(u,v)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle w&#39;,\\langle0,v\\rangle\\rangle:v\\in W\\},\\\\\nV&#39;(i)&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,v\\rangle:v\\in V(i)\\}\\cup\\{w&#39;:w\\in V(i)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M&#39;&amp;:=\\langle W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal M&#39;,w&#39;\\Vdash_m A&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧世界及其后继结构保持，故旧世界所有公式的真值不变。对 A 的子式归纳，命题部分直接成立。若旧根满足 □C，根反射给它也满足 C，于是新根的全部后继都满足 C；反向，新根的后继含旧根的全部后继。对子公式集封闭性使归纳适用。标签 0、1 保证新增根不与原世界重合，且构造仍传递非自反。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-root-sound-modal-model","status":"resolved","id":"856b3762c593e8c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-root-sound-modal-model","status":"resolved","id":"856b3762c593e8c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle$ 是传递非自反框架上的模型，$w$ 是根；$\\Phi$ 对子公式封闭，$\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi}(\\mathcal M,w)$。语义取 [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi}(\\mathcal M,w)","display":false},{"tex":"W',w'","display":false},{"tex":"R',V',\\mathcal M'","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"W':=\\{0\\}\\times W\\ \\cup\\ \\{\\langle1,w\\rangle\\},\\qquad w':=\\langle1,w\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR'&:=\\{\\langle\\langle0,u\\rangle,\\langle0,v\\rangle\\rangle:R(u,v)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle w',\\langle0,v\\rangle\\rangle:v\\in W\\},\\\\\nV'(i)&:=\\{\\langle0,v\\rangle:v\\in V(i)\\}\\cup\\{w':w\\in V(i)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M'&:=\\langle W',R',V'\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal M',w'\\Vdash_m A&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2035,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-544","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"}],"outgoing":["856b3762c593e8c1"]}